OL,3,ANew data shows fall in visas, asylum
OL,4,Aclaims, and small boat arrivals
OL,5,Acompared to year earlier
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Home Office has just published new
OL,8,Fquarterly statistics on the UK
OL,9,Fimmigration system - we are combing
OL,10,Fthrough the data to bring you key lines
OL,11,Fas soon as possible
OL,13,FThe data includes numbers on key
OL,14,Fmigration measures - visas,
OL,15,Fcitizenship, small boats, and asylum
OL,16,Fhotels and applications - in the year
OL,17,Fto June
OL,19,FFor a closer look, our migration
OL,20,Ftracker has the latest numbers on
OL,21,Fmigration to the UK
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
