OL,3,APeople deserve to feel safe, says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a town where nine
OL,7,Fpeople have been killed in a crash and
OL,8,Ffire in the past week deserve to "feel
OL,9,Fsafe in their own homes", a council
OL,10,Fleader has said.
OL,12,FRedcar and Cleveland Borough Council
OL,13,Fleader Alec Brown's comments come after
OL,14,Fseven people, including two police
OL,15,Fofficers, died in a car crash at South
OL,16,FBank, near Middlesbrough, on Saturday
OL,17,Fand a 34-year-old woman and
OL,18,Fseven-year-old girl died in a house
OL,19,Ffire in Grangetown on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
