OL,3,APeople deserve to feel safe, says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown told Radio 4's Today programme he
OL,7,Fhad called an "urgent meeting" on
OL,8,FFriday among councillors, police and
OL,9,Fsocial housing providers.
OL,11,FPolice have made several arrests in
OL,12,Fconnection with the recent deaths.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
